# cq-22: 직업안정기관에 출석하기 어려우면 실업의 신고와 실업의 인정을 어떻게 받는가?
PREFIX cv: <http://data.europa.eu/m8g/>
PREFIX dct: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
PREFIX eli: <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#>
PREFIX foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/>
PREFIX employment: <https://w3id.org/kr-employment/>

SELECT ?item ?source WHERE {
  {
    VALUES ?item { employment:unemployment-report employment:unemployment-recognition }
  } UNION {
    VALUES ?service { employment:unemployment-report employment:unemployment-recognition }
    ?service cv:hasChannel ?item .
  } UNION {
    employment:unemployment-recognition cv:relatedService ?item .
  } UNION {
    employment:unemployment-recognition cv:relatedService/cv:hasChannel ?item .
  }
  ?note foaf:primaryTopic ?item ;
        dct:source ?expression .
  ?expression eli:realizes ?source .
}
